It basically goes to the signal server, and the signal server says, Here is the AI agent, here is the address of the AI agent,
and then the user directly connect with the AI agent in a peer-to-peer connections.

72
00:10:01,966 --> 00:10:04,656
因此，它不会经过任何服务器。
