In case of SFU, what happens is everyone goes to LivePed SFU and SFU manage it.

273
00:32:12,912 --> 00:32:17,472
所以基本上，这个客户端只需要订阅他们需要访问的轨道。
So basically, this client have to subscribe to the tracks that they need to access.

274
00:32:17,632 --> 00:32:20,432
例如，一个 AI Agent 是一个语音 AI Agent。
For example, an AI agent is a voiceai agent.

275
00:32:20,512 --> 00:32:26,752
如果它是一个语音 AI Agent，那么就没有必要让它订阅视频轨道了，对吧？
So if it is a voice AI agent, there is no need for the voice AI agent to subscribe to a video track, right?

276
00:32:26,832 --> 00:32:33,072
所以当你设计 AI Agent 系统时，你会说，我不需要视频轨道。
So you when you design your AI agent system, you would say, I don't want a video track.

277
00:32:33,232 --> 00:32:44,484
我只需要订阅音频轨道，或者可能只是订阅获取文本输出的数据流，
因为你的 AI Agent 可能只是为了聊天，它没有多模态的使用场景。
All I would do is just subscribe to audio tracks, or maybe just subscribe to the data stream where you get the text output because
your AI agent maybe is meant for only chat, it doesn't have multimodal use case.

278
00:32:44,592 --> 00:32:56,644
所以基于此，你定义你的 AI Agent，它会连接到 SFU，并且只会订阅比如音频轨道或数据流，
然后 SFU 就会负责管理轨道的分配。
So based on that, you define your AI agent, it will go to the SFU and it will only subscribe for let's say audio track or data or data
stream, and then SFU will actually manage the track distribution.

279
00:32:57,262 --> 00:32:58,272
你明白我的意思吗？
Does it make sense to you?

280
00:32:58,574 --> 00:33:02,992
这就是 LiveKit 管理 SFU 的基本方式。
So that's how they basically live kit is managing the SFU.

281
00:33:03,072 --> 00:33:10,340
所以 LiveKit 节点内置了 SFU 节点，它还内置了 TURN 服务器和 STUN 服务器。
So LiveKit node have SFU nodes built in it, and it also have the turn server and stun server built in it.

282
00:33:11,566 --> 00:33:22,148
所以当你打算在节点上自托管 LiveKit 服务器时，那个节点就会包含 SFU，
并且内置了 STUN 和 TURN 服务器。
So when you are going to self-host a live kit server in a node, that
node will have SFU and it will have stun and turn servers built into it.

283
00:33:23,712 --> 00:33:24,032
但是
But

