00:33:28,526 --> 00:33:39,952
问题是，如果有一个 SFU 在管理来自 5、10 或 15 个客户端的媒体流，
这个 SFU 肯定会被耗尽的，对吧？
the question is if there is one SFU managing media streams from 5, 10, 15 clients, this SFU must be exhausted, right?

285
00:33:40,112 --> 00:33:53,092
如果需要处理的媒体流太多，那么 SFU 实际上就比 MCU 更好，正如他们在博客中讨论的那样。
If there are too many media streams that it needs to process, so SFU actually
that is where is better than MCU, which they have discussed in this blog.

286
00:33:53,582 --> 00:34:03,492
那个 SFU 是可以水平扩展的，这意味着你可以拥有多个节点，
你可以根据需要增加更多的 SFU 节点来处理更多的任务。
That SFU is horizontally scalable, that means you can have multiple nodes,
SFU nodes you can spin up as and when you need more and more processing.

287
00:34:03,872 --> 00:34:12,516
但接下来的问题是，SFU 节点如何确保同一个轨道不会被不同的节点重复处理。
But then the question is how the SFU node would ensure that same track is not being reprocessed by different node.

288
00:34:12,752 --> 00:34:13,552
你肯定不希望那样发生，对吧？
You don't want that, right?

289
00:34:13,632 --> 00:34:19,748
假设客户端 2 发送了他们的视频流，并且该流已经被处理并发送给其他客户端了。
Let's say client to have sent their video stream and that is already processed and sent to other clients.

290
00:34:20,174 --> 00:34:24,964
你肯定不希望新节点（也就是节点 2）再次去重复处理它。
You don't want the new node, which is node 2, to reprocess that again.

291
00:34:25,742 --> 00:34:31,940
为了实现这一点，如果你想销售 LiveKit，你就需要部署一个 Redis 集群。
For that, there is a Redis cluster that you need to spin up if you want to sell FOST Live kit.

292
00:34:32,351 --> 00:34:41,348
节点会连接到这个 Redis，它会保存会话状态、保存上下文、保存媒体状态以及所有其他信息。
And this Redis is where the node will connect to and it will save the session state, it will save the context,
it will save the media states and everything.

293
00:34:41,774 --> 00:34:52,484
所以当新节点启动或在集群中运行时，它们基本上共享这些信息的状态，并能正确地处理它们。
So that new nodes as they spin up or as they are operational in a cluster, they basically share they basically get the state of the
information and they basically process it properly.

294
00:34:53,101 --> 00:34:59,392
这意味着在真正的 LiveKit 架构中，你需要一个负载均衡器。
So that means in a true live kit architecture, you need to have a load balancer.

295
00:34:59,472 --> 00:35:11,972
这意味着每个客户端或 Agent 都需要通过负载均衡器，连
接到提供 SFU 服务的节点，而这些节点将连接到 Redis。
That means each client or agent needs to come through the load balancer and connect to the nodes for the SFU services,
and these nodes will be connected to the Redis.

296
00:35:12,398 --> 00:35:22,244
甚至更好的架构是提供一个 Redis 集群，这样在生
产环境中需要任何回退方案时，你还有 Redis 副本。
Even the better architecture will be to have even a Redis cluster available so that in case of any fallback that is needed in a
production setup, you have a Redis replica as well.

