00:39:05,134 --> 00:39:21,860
这意味着，每当你的 AI Agent 初始化任何流时，这个 WHIP 服务器基本上会检查该流是否需要
为所有终端用户或 Web 或 WebRTC client 进行转码。
So that means, whenever your AI agent initialize any stream, basically, then this WHIP server basically check if that stream needs to
be transcoded for all of the end users or web or web.c client.

