00:39:25,136 --> 00:39:40,420
如果需要，Web 服务器将对其进行转码，然后通过 SFU 将其转发给终端用户；如果没有需要，
它将直接把通信或流传输给终端用户。
If if needed, then the web server will basically transcode it and then it will forward it to the end user through SFU,
or if there is no need, then it will basically directly transfer the communications or the streams to the end user.

